  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Although NILs formed by selection have generally focused on phenotypic characters such as disease resistance or a small set of desirable characters, one can also select for the retention of specific donor marker alleles. Such marker selection allows the introgression of a specific region (such as one containing QTLs of",
