    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Since these equations refer to the proportion of this chromosome retained, the corresponding chromosome lengths retained are given by $ L_M \\cdot p_M(b) $, yielding a mean length $ \\pm $ SD (in Morgans) of $ 2/t \\pm \\sqrt{2}/t $ for $ t \\leq L_M \\geq 1 $.",
